          "quote":"- An execution environment is the concrete means that performs those\n  operations: a technology stack; a human process, made of people, roles,\n  documents, communication channels and decision procedures; or a\n  combination of the two.",
          "section_id":"repo://stdo-v3-common/35fb4824a064a84df5af214a0d0e2da597c18ac6/source/standards/SPEC_METHOD.md#SPEC_METHOD%2F11.%20Build-tenant%20binding",
