      "definition":"In TICKETS, Goals is the current epic layer located by ticketing.goals, with GOALS.md as default. Broader than one ticket and narrower/more current than intent, it states the active wave and current priorities, not durable execution tracking.",
      "exceptions": [],
      "grounding": [
        {
          "end_line":35,
          "quote":"The product definition's `ticketing.goals` binding locates the current epic\nlayer; `GOALS.md` is the default file (PRODUCT_DEFINITION §1). Goals are\nbroader than one ticket, narrower and more current than the intent surface,\nand the place to state the active work wave and what matters now. Goals are\nnot the durable unit of execution tracking (P2, P3).",
