      "statement":"The adoption chain expresses authority causality, prescribing neither intake workflow nor artifact set. Accompanying tools, runtimes, schemas or assurance implementations require their own Product authorisation; a method lesson does not admit them. Other standards consume admitted law by reference. Consumers explicitly select one complete released version and cannot mix members from different cuts.",
